              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nakibwaikiniata ikadukok apeteta nuka eyekalu laka EJAKAIT, kisibwaata isasedotin enapitos ikecenapen ekapitos arupepen, ka Ilebin odwe luka Asap ekapitos aisinin, airuritor EJAKAIT, kwape kitemonokinitor Daudi ekabaka loka Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
